OL,3,GNEWSANew town centre square and library
OL,4,Aopen in Huddersfield
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new library and public space in
OL,7,FHuddersfield have been opened - the
OL,8,Ffirst parts of a #260m revamp of the
OL,9,Ftown centre.
OL,11,FThe development, on part of the old
OL,12,FPiazza Shopping Centre, replaces dozens
OL,13,Fof shop units with a large public
OL,14,Fsquare.
OL,16,FBut, a covered food hall in the old
OL,17,Fmarket building that was supposed to
OL,18,Fopen in summer 2026 has been delayed
OL,19,Funtil next year.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
