OL,3,GNEWSANew town centre square and library
OL,4,Aopen in Huddersfield
OL,5,
OL,6,FKirklees Council decided against
OL,7,Fappointing a private operator to run
OL,8,Fthe venture, taking the decision to
OL,9,Fmanage the operation itself.
